# Copy cac bien can thiet vao tu file .env.example cua tung app.
# Local dev: cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env (tuong tu dashboard, miniapp)
#
# Deploy Vercel (2 project, KHONG can server rieng):
# 1) Supabase: tao project free -> chay apps/api/migrations/001_init.sql
# 2) Project "checkin-api": Root Directory = apps/api
#    Build Command = pnpm --filter @checkin/shared build  (hoac de trong + dung vercel-build)
#    Env: ADMIN_EMAIL, ADMIN_PASSWORD, ADMIN_TOKEN, SUPABASE_URL,
#         SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, MINI_APP_ID
# 3) Project "checkin-dashboard": Root Directory = apps/dashboard
#    Env: VITE_API_URL=https://<ten-api>.vercel.app
# 4) Mini App: upload apps/miniapp/dist len https://miniapp.zaloplatforms.com/
#    voi VITE_API_URL=https://<ten-api>.vercel.app truoc khi build.
